        "rationale": "Round-2 measured 6.51709. Diagnostics showed the nearest labelled cells above/below each contact already sit at their theoretical vertical distances, and an independent optimization of an ideal horizontal surface at each drillhole gives a floor of 6.51388 for this fixed objective (including contact mean/variance coupling). The added continuous plus fine coordinate polish of the flat-patch heights reduced the local score reproducibly to 6.5166 with 0 label mismatches and contact RMSE 0.268, about 34 s of the 120 s budget. Public selfcheck still passes; the remaining ~0.003 gap is due to the smooth transition geometry between the four contact patches."
